 "insight": [
  "The total value of Luxembourg's exports to Japan and China in 2025 was 288.9 million euros, while imports reached 1.89 billion euros.",
  "Exports decreased by 6.8% compared to 2024, when they were 309.9 million euros.",
  "Imports increased sharply by 401.1% from 376.9 million euros in 2024 to 1.89 billion euros in 2025.",
  "This large rise in imports is the most notable change between the two years.",
  "The values are given in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
